  "cacheVersion": "2026-05-13-gear-cards",
  "html": "<p class=\"\"><a href=\"https://globalenergymonitor.org/projects/global-energy-ownership-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://globalenergymonitor.org/projects/global-energy-ownership-tracker\">Global Energy Monitor's Ownership Tracker</a> is a giant network: thousands of owners — governments, corporations, private equity firms, and the intermediaries between them — connected to tens of thousands of energy-related assets around the world. It's a rich dataset that had been genuinely hard to explore, so we built a set of tools to open it up. You can trace the full ownership chain behind a single project (down to the stakes held by the likes of BlackRock and EDF), see the whole energy-asset portfolio connected to one owner, and screen owners by what they actually own — coal-based steel plants, proposed mines in BRICS countries, captive gas plants for data centers.</p>\n<p class=\"\">It's built for the digging: investigating a corporation's clean-energy claims, following investment patterns, or tracing who ultimately owns a piece of the world's energy infrastructure. The ownership chain is where a lot of the truth is.</p>\n<p class=\"\">I collaborated on viz prototyping and front-end development, working with Stephen Osserman and Anna Mowat at Global Energy Monitor, Third Bear Solutions on the underlying data pipeline, and Nadieh Bremer on vis design.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Ownership network for the Sines power station\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/sines.png\" alt=\"Ownership network for the Sines power station\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/gem-viz/sines.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/gem-viz/sines.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/sines.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/gem-viz/sines.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Ownership network for the Sines power station\" width=\"2880\" height=\"1800\" style=\"--splay-rot:-1.47deg;\" data-dimensions=\"2880×1800\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Ownership network for the Sines power station</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Every energy asset in the Global Energy Monitor database, mapped\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/worldmap.png\" alt=\"Every energy asset in the Global Energy Monitor database, mapped\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/gem-viz/worldmap.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/gem-viz/worldmap.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/worldmap.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/gem-viz/worldmap.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Every energy asset in the Global Energy Monitor database, mapped\" width=\"2880\" height=\"1800\" style=\"--splay-rot:0.97deg;\" data-dimensions=\"2880×1800\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Every energy asset in the Global Energy Monitor database, mapped</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Tracing a power station up to Bank of America\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/drax.png\" alt=\"Tracing a power station up to Bank of America\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/gem-viz/drax.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/gem-viz/drax.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/drax.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/gem-viz/drax.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Tracing a power station up to Bank of America\" width=\"1042\" height=\"516\" style=\"--splay-rot:-1.91deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1042×516\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Tracing a power station up to Bank of America</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"An asset&#x27;s corporate ownership graph\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/network.png\" alt=\"An asset&#x27;s corporate ownership graph\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/gem-viz/network.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/gem-viz/network.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/network.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/gem-viz/network.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"An asset&#x27;s corporate ownership graph\" width=\"2400\" height=\"2262\" style=\"--splay-rot:2.09deg;\" data-dimensions=\"2400×2262\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay aspect-square w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">An asset's corporate ownership graph</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Drilling into the owners of a binational pipeline\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/owners.png\" alt=\"Drilling into the owners of a binational pipeline\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/gem-viz/owners.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/gem-viz/owners.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/gem-viz/owners.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/gem-viz/owners.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Drilling into the owners of a binational pipeline\" width=\"1310\" height=\"1204\" style=\"--splay-rot:2.21deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1310×1204\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay aspect-square w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Drilling into the owners of a binational pipeline</figcaption>\n</figure>",
